{
  "id": "sm-cost-attribution-labels",
  "title": "Attribute Synthetic Monitoring costs to teams and services",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Group Synthetic Monitoring costs by team: configure an attribution key, then give it a value on a check."
    },
    {
      "type": "callout",
      "title": "Before you begin",
      "content": "Use an existing check you can edit. Creating an attribution key requires Cost attribution admin permission."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Use an existing Synthetics attribution key, or create `team` if none is configured."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "open-the-starting-page",
      "title": "Set up cost attribution",
      "requirements": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings",
          "content": "Open **Cost Management and Billing → Settings**.",
          "tooltip": "Start with the keys your organization uses to divide its costs.",
          "requirements": [],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings"
        },
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "id": "attribution-settings-open",
          "conditions": [
            "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings"
          ],
          "whenTrue": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "id": "synthetics-key-configured",
              "conditions": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ],
              "reftarget": "main div:has(:scope > div > div > span:contains('Synthetics'))",
              "whenTrue": [
                {
                  "type": "markdown",
                  "content": "A Synthetics attribution key is already configured. Continue to label your check."
                }
              ],
              "whenFalse": [
                {
                  "type": "multistep",
                  "id": "configure-attribution-key",
                  "content": "Create a `team` attribution key for Synthetics.",
                  "requirements": [
                    "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings",
                    "has-permission:grafana-cmab-app.costattribution:write"
                  ],
                  "steps": [
                    {
                      "action": "button",
                      "reftarget": "[data-testid='synthetics-attribution-configure']",
                      "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings"
                      ],
                      "tooltip": "Open the dialog to add the approved cost dimension."
                    },
                    {
                      "action": "formfill",
                      "reftarget": "[data-testid='synthetics-attribution-label-key']",
                      "targetvalue": "team",
                      "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings"
                      ],
                      "tooltip": "Enter and select the approved key."
                    },
                    {
                      "action": "button",
                      "reftarget": "[data-testid='synthetics-attribution-label-save']",
                      "requirements": [
                        "exists-reftarget",
                        "on-page:/a/grafana-cmab-app/settings"
                      ],
                      "tooltip": "Save the new cost dimension without changing existing keys."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "whenFalse": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Return to Settings to review your Synthetics attribution keys."
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "autoCollapse": false
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "The attribution key defines how Synthetics costs are grouped."
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "Add a team or service value to an existing check."
    },
    {
      "type": "section",
      "id": "attribute-synthetic-monitoring-costs-to",
      "title": "Label your check",
      "requirements": [],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "navigate",
          "reftarget": "/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks",
          "content": "Open **Checks**.",
          "tooltip": "Connect the cost dimension to the checks that generate the usage.",
          "requirements": [],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true,
          "verify": "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "highlight",
          "reftarget": "main a[href^='/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks/'][href$='/edit']:nth-match(1)",
          "content": "Open the first check for editing.",
          "tooltip": "Open the first check in the list.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
          ],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "interactive",
          "action": "button",
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor navigation labels']",
          "content": "Open **Labels**.",
          "tooltip": "Compare the configured cost dimensions with this check’s existing values.",
          "requirements": [
            "exists-reftarget",
            "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
          ],
          "doIt": true,
          "showMe": true
        },
        {
          "type": "conditional",
          "id": "check-labels-open",
          "conditions": [
            "exists-reftarget"
          ],
          "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor navigation labels'][aria-selected='true']",
          "whenTrue": [
            {
              "type": "conditional",
              "id": "attribution-fields-available",
              "conditions": [
                "exists-reftarget"
              ],
              "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"costAttribution fields\"]",
              "whenTrue": [
                {
                  "type": "interactive",
                  "action": "highlight",
                  "reftarget": "[data-testid=\"costAttribution fields\"]",
                  "content": "Under **Cost attribution labels**, enter the team or service responsible for this check, for example `platform`. Keep any existing correct values.",
                  "tooltip": "Fill only missing or incorrect values and preserve labels that already describe ownership.",
                  "requirements": [
                    "exists-reftarget",
                    "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
                  ],
                  "doIt": false,
                  "showMe": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "interactive",
                  "action": "button",
                  "reftarget": "[data-testid='checkEditor form submit']",
                  "content": "Save the check. Skip this step if you kept its existing values.",
                  "tooltip": "Confirm the saved check carries the intended cost dimensions and values.",
                  "requirements": [
                    "exists-reftarget",
                    "on-page:/a/grafana-synthetic-monitoring-app/checks"
                  ],
                  "doIt": true,
                  "showMe": true,
                  "skippable": true
                }
              ],
              "whenFalse": [
                {
                  "type": "callout",
                  "title": "Attribution fields not available",
                  "content": "If **Labels** shows **Set up cost attribution**, wait briefly and reopen the check. If the fields are still missing, ask your administrator to check the attribution setup."
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "whenFalse": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "content": "Open the check’s **Labels** tab to enter its attribution value."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "After saving, reopen the check and its **Labels** tab to confirm the attribution value was saved."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "New usage is attributed using the check’s saved value; historical usage is not backfilled."
    }
  ]
}
